    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d263-a1">

                <pb facs="0361" n="287" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg287"/>


                <head>Mr. Asboth to Señor Elizalde.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hotel de Provence,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Buenos Ayres,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-10-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 15, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you of my
                    arrival at this capital under commission as minister resident of the United
                    States of America to the government of the Argentine Republic, and would request
                    that you may be pleased to ascertain the wishes of his Excellency the President
                    as to the delivery of my letter of credence. At the same time I beg leave to
                    enclose <pb facs="0362" n="288" xml:id="pg288"/> for his Excellency the
                    President the letter of recall of my predecessor, the Hon. Robert G. Kirk, as
                    well as a certified copy of my own credentials and the wording of my intended
                    address.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with distinguished consideration, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>A. ASBOTH.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency Señor Dr. Don <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rufino de
                            Elizalde,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c</hi>., <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c.</hi>,
                            <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
